{
  "uid": "platzwart-web",
  "title": "Web und Zertifikat",
  "description": "Anfragen, Antwortzeiten und Zustand von Caddy. Quelle: Caddys Verwaltungsschnittstelle ueber platzwart-metriken.",
  "tags": [
    "platzwart"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Woher die Zahlen kommen",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Diese Seite braucht den Schalter **Caddy-Zugriffe** unter *Module*. Caddy zählt Anfragen nur, wenn in der Caddyfile `servers { metrics }` steht — sonst bleiben alle Tafeln ausser *Neuladen* leer.\n\n*Needs the Caddy switch; Caddy only counts requests with the `metrics` option set.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Anfragen",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Anfragen je Sekunde",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "platzwart-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Nach Art der Zustellung: reverse_proxy ist das Panel, file_server die Statusseite.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 18,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "platzwart-prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (handler) (rate(caddy_http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{handler}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
